1
00:00:00,134 --> 00:00:02,674
(Howard:)...are two not unattractive
middle-school teachers...

2
00:00:02,845 --> 00:00:04,425
(Howard:)...who reek of desperation.

3
00:00:05,973 --> 00:00:09,763
(Raj:)-Wonderful. How old are they?
-I don't know, 50, 55?

4
00:00:11,228 --> 00:00:12,688
Oh, menopause. Heh.

5
00:00:14,023 --> 00:00:16,233
(Raj:)Nature's birth control.

6
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:19,190
(Leonard:)Come on. You guys can't be that hard up.

7
00:00:19,737 --> 00:00:21,237
(Howard:)-I am.
-Yeah, me too.

8
00:00:22,823 --> 00:00:24,653
(Howard:)Look, they gave me homemade cookies.

9
00:00:24,825 --> 00:00:27,365
(Leonard:)Of course they did.
That's what grandmothers do.

10
00:00:27,536 --> 00:00:30,076
(Raj:)-So, what are we waiting for?
-Relax.

11
00:00:30,247 --> 00:00:33,997
(Howard:)I said we'd stop by a little later,
after they have their nap.

12
00:00:34,209 --> 00:00:36,249
(Raj:)-Good idea. They'll be refreshed.
HOWARD: Yeah.

13
00:00:37,296 --> 00:00:39,426
(Howard:)-Cookie?
-Thank you.

14
00:00:40,215 --> 00:00:42,175
RAJESH:
Mmm.

15
00:00:42,343 --> 00:00:45,933
(Leonard:)-Mm. Not bad.
-Yeah, very tasty.

16
00:00:46,096 --> 00:00:47,806
(Raj:)Tell me more about these teachers.

17
00:00:47,973 --> 00:00:50,353
(Howard:)Not much to tell.
They had a VW Microbus...

18
00:00:50,517 --> 00:00:53,687
(Howard:)...and were wearing
tie-dyed Grateful Dead T-shirts.

19
00:00:54,021 --> 00:00:57,441
Huh. Hm.

20
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:03,020
(Raj:)Good cookies.

